    class Encounter {
        -PlayerShip player
        -EnemyShip enemy
        -Random random
        +Encounter(PlayerShip player, EnemyShip enemy, Random random)
        +roll(Location where, PlayerShip player, Random random)$ Encounter
        +fight() String
        +flee() String
        +getEnemy() EnemyShip
        +describe() String
    }

    Game "1" *-- "1" Terminal : lines in, text out
    Game ..> Command : parses each line
    Game ..> InvalidCommandException : catches, prints message
    Game ..> GameMode : derives each turn
    Game "1" *-- "1" ChannelMap : sail targets
    Game "1" *-- "1" PlayerShip : player
    Game "1" o-- "0..1" Encounter : current fight
    Command --> Verb
    ChannelMap "1" *-- "25" Location : stops
    Location "1" --> "1..5" Location : neighbours
    Location <|-- Port
    Location --> LocationKind
    Port ..> PlayerShip : sells repair, crew, rum, upgrades
    Ship <|-- PlayerShip
    Ship <|-- EnemyShip
    Ship "1" *-- "1" Crew
    PlayerShip --> Location : current stop
    EnemyShip --> EnemyType : base stats
    Encounter --> PlayerShip : damage, plunder
    Encounter "1" *-- "1" EnemyShip : opponent
